<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001824> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Information Bearing Entity b1 is excerpted from another Information Bearing Entity B2 iff b1 is part of some Information Bearing Entity B1 that is carrier of some Information Content Entity C1, B2 is carrier of some Information Content Entity C2, C1 is not identical with C2, b1 is carrier of some Information Content Entity c1, b2 is an Information Bearing Entity that is part of B2 and b2 is carrier of c1 (i.e. the same Information Content Entity as borne by b1)."@en _:N88355ae2721847b3bb77370baee5ef13 .
