<https://github.com/jonathanvajda/cco-d-acts> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "CCO-D-Acts is designed to fill a gap in representation of social, legal, normative, and deontic entities for ontologies that rely on the Common Core Ontologies (CCO) suite (https://github.com/CommonCoreOntology/CommonCoreOntologies). Within the Basic Formal Ontology (BFO) ecosystem, the Document Acts (D-Acts) ontology (https://github.com/d-acts/d-acts) is an extension of the OBO Foundry Information Artifact Ontology (IAO). This ontology proposes to transpose that OBO ontology into a CCO equivalent."@en _:N88355ae2721847b3bb77370baee5ef13 .
